<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAL" style="id">RRK39.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">MALAKI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Nabi Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mal</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA NABI</para>
  <para style="mt1">MALAKI</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAL 1" />
  <para style="s1">Rukundo ya Ruhanga ahari Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 1:1" />Eki n'ekigambo kya MUKAMA ekyahanuuriirwe Israeli nikiraba omuri Malaki.<verse eid="MAL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2, 3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 9:13">Rom 9:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Nkabakunda; kwonka imwe nimubuuza muti: Okatukunda ota? MUKAMA naagira ati: Esau akaba atari mukuru wa Yakobo? Kwonka nkakunda Yakobo,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:8">Bir 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:3">Yer 31:3</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="MAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:18">Yer 49:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:3">Ezk 35:3</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:19">Yoel 3:19</ref>. </char></note> Esau naamwanga; ensi ye y'ebibungo naagihindura eihamba, n'obuhunguzi bwe naabuha zaamuha z'omu ihamba. <verse eid="MAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 1:4" />Edomu n'obu araagire ati: Tushenyagwirwe, kwonka nitwija kugaruka kwombeka ebyasheenyukire; MUKAMA naagira ati: Nibombekye, kwonka niinyija kubisheenya, okuhitsya obu abantu baribeeta ensi esiisikaire, abantu abu MUKAMA atuura naagirira ekiniga ebiro byona. <verse eid="MAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 1:5" />Amaisho gaanyu garyakyereebera, mugire muti: MUKAMA ni mukuru, n'obukuru bwe niburenga emyatano ya Israeli!<verse eid="MAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebibi by'abanyamurwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 4:22">Kur 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:12">20:12</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 11:1">Hos 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:46">Luk 6:46</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe banyamurwa 'mwe abarikugaya eiziina ryangye, omwana aha ishe ekitiinisa, n'omuheereza akiha mukama we. Mbwenu ku ndaabe ndi shoimwe, ekitiinisa kyangye kirahi? Nari shi ku ndaabe ndi mukama waanyu, okutiinwa kwangye kurahi? Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. Kandi imwe nimugira muti: Beitu eiziina ryawe niturigaya tuta? <verse eid="MAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 1:7" />Nimurigayira omu kuhongyera empongano z'eby'okurya bisiisikaire aha itambiro ryangye. Kandi nimugira muti: Nitubishiisha tuta? Ahabw'okuba nimugira muti: Emeeza ya MUKAMA n'ey'okugaywa. <verse eid="MAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:22">Lev 22:22</ref>. </char></note> Obu muba nimutamba ebitambo by'enyamaishwa ezihumire, mugira ngu ekyo ti kibi? Obu muba nimuhonga eziremaire, nari ezirwaire, ekyo kyo ti kibi? Irooko obihongyere omutegyeki waawe. Noogira ngu naija kukusiima? Naija kukureeba gye? Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="MAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Bir 10:17</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu, mweshengyereze Ruhanga abaikirize, abone kutugirira embabazi. Ku muraabe nimumuhongyera ebirikushusha bityo, naabaasa ata kubaikiriza? Nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. <verse eid="MAL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:11">Isa 1:11</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 1:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:20">Yer 6:20</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:21">Amo 5:21</ref>. </char></note> Nkaabaasibwa ki omwe omuriimwe akinga enyigi, mureka kuguma nimuhembera busha omuriro aha itambiro ryangye! Tindikubashemerererwa na kakye, kandi tindikwija kwikiriza mpongano yoona ei murampongyere; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. <verse eid="MAL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:3">60:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:1">65:1</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga oburugwa-izooba okuhika oburengyerwa-izooba eiziina ryangye ni rikuru omu mahanga, kandi omuri buri mwanya gwona eiziina ryangye niryotererwa obubaane, kandi nirihongyerwa empongano ezishemeire; ahabw'okuba eiziina ryangye ni rikuru omu mahanga; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. <verse eid="MAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 1:12" />Kwonka imwe nimurihemura, obu murikuba nimugira muti: Emeeza ya MUKAMA esiisikaire, n'eby'okurya ebigiriho n'eby'okugaywa. <verse eid="MAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:20">Lev 22:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:22">Isa 43:22</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:3">Mik 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:14">Mal 3:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nimugira muti: Ebi ka byaturusya! Kandi nimubyeshaanya; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. Nimureeta ekinyagirwe n'amaani, nari ekiremaire, nari ekirwaire, ngu ebyo ga mukireetsire kukihonga; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. <verse eid="MAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:5">Kur 12:5</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 22:21">Lev 22:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 47:2">Zab 47:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 76:12">76:12</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu endeebya akyeenwe, oine empaya omu busyo bwe, akahiga naaraganisa kugiha Ruhanga, kwonka akiza kutambira MUKAMA, akamutambira eine akamogo; ahabw'okuba ndi Omugabe mukuru, kandi eiziina ryangye ritiinwa omu mahanga; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="MAL 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAL 2" />
  <para style="s1">Abaleevi okwita endagaano ya Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 1:6">Mal 1:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu imwe banyamurwa 'mwe, ekiragiro eki n'ekyanyu. <verse eid="MAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:9">Mal 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:14">Lev 26:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:15">Bir 28:15</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA ow'amahe naagira ati: Ku muraayangye kuhurira, mwayanga kuta omutima aha kuhaisa eiziina ryangye ekitiinisa, niinyija kubooherereza omukyeeno, n'emigisha yaanyu ngikyeene; kandi buzimazima naaherize kugikyeena, ahabw'okuba mwangire kukita aha mutima. <verse eid="MAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:14">Kur 29:14</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 1:17">Yoel 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 3:6">Nah 3:6</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, ndyahana oruzaaro rwanyu, mbasiigye amasha g'empongano zaanyu ahamaisho, mbacwe omu maisho gangye. <verse eid="MAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:45">Kub 3:45</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 25:12">25:12</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 25:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 13:29">Neh 13:29</ref>. </char></note> Haza obwo nibwo murimanya, ku niinye naabahaire ekyo kiragiro, ngu endagaano ei naaragaine na Leevi ebone kugumaho; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. <verse eid="MAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:10">Isa 54:10</ref>. </char></note> Egyo ndagaano ei naaragaine nawe ekaba eri endagaano y'amagara n'obusingye; nkabimuha ngu atiine; kandi yantiina, yaagira obwoba ahabw'eiziina ryangye. <verse eid="MAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:3">Dan 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:20">Yak 5:20</ref>. </char></note> Okwegyesa eby'amazima kukaba kutamuruga mu kanwa, kandi akaba atashangwa naagamba ebitahikire. Akaba agyendera naanye omu busingye n'omu kuhikiirira, kandi akaba ahindura baingi okuruga omu bibi. <verse eid="MAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:11">Lev 10:11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17:9">Bir 17:9</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 1:13">Hag 1:13</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba eminwa y'omunyamurwa eshemereire kurinda okumanya, n'abantu bashemereire kuba niwe baayehabuzaho; ahabw'okuba n'entumwa ya MUKAMA ow'amahe. <verse eid="MAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:17">1 Sam 2:17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 22:26">Ezk 22:26</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka imwe muteeshukire omuhanda, muteerize baingi entsibo omu bi murikwegyesa; mwashiisha endagaano ya Leevi; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. <verse eid="MAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:17">Bir 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:19">16:19</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 2:30">1 Sam 2:30</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo ndikubagayisiza, nkabahindura abataine kitiinisa omu maisho g'abantu boona, ahabw'okuba timurarinzire biragiro byangye, kureka mukashoroora abantu omubi murikwegyesa, mwagira orubaju.<verse eid="MAL 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebibi by'abantu ba Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 2:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:35">Bir 4:35</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 4:39">39</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 33:1">Isa 33:1</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 8:6">1 Kor 8:6</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:6">Efe 4:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Twena titwine Tataitwe omwe? Ruhanga owaatuhangire t'omwe? Ahabw'enki buri muntu ti mwesigwa ahari mugyenzi we, nitushiisha endagaano ya baatatenkuriitwe? <verse eid="MAL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:2">Ezr 9:2</ref>. </char></note> Yuda tabaire mwesigwa, kandi omuri Israeli na Yerusaalemu hakozirwemu ebirikunugwa; ahabw'okuba Yuda ahagaire Omwanya gwa MUKAMA ogurikwera, ogu arikukunda, yaashwera muhara wa ruhanga w'enduga-mahanga. <verse eid="MAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 2:12" />Omuntu orikutwaza atyo, nkaabaasibwa ki MUKAMA amumariraho kimwe omuntu weena ow'okuhamya, ow'okugarukamu, nari ow'okuhongyera MUKAMA ow'amahe, omu mahema ga Yakobo!<verse eid="MAL 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebibi by'omu maka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 2:13" />Kandi eki nakyo nimukikora. Nimwitsa eitambiro rya MUKAMA amarira gaanyu, nimurira kandi nimuborooga, ahabw'okuba takyeta ha mpongano ezi murikuhonga, n'obu kwakuba okuziikiriza ashemereirwe. <verse eid="MAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 2:14" />Kwonka nimubuuza muti: Ahabw'enki atarikubiikiriza? Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA akaba kareebi w'okuhamya endagaano ei waaragaine n'omukazi w'omu butsigazi bwawe, ou waareebize, haza ari mugyenzi waawe, kandi omukazi waawe ou waaragaine nawe endagaano. <verse eid="MAL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Kut 2:24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:4">Mat 19:4</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 19:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga ogwo omwe taratuhangiire omwoyo gw'amagara, akagutugumizaho? Mbwenu ekindi naayenda ki? Naayenda oruzaaro orurikutiina Ruhanga. N'ahabw'ekyo mwerinde, hatagira owaareebya omukazi w'omu butsigazi bwe. <verse eid="MAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:9">Mak 10:9</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 10:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli naagira ati: Nyanga okushenda, n'omuntu orikweshwekyerera, aine obubisha aha mukazi we; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. N'ahabw'ekyo mwerinde, murekye kuba endeebya.<verse eid="MAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 2:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:20">Isa 5:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:24">43:24</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>, <ref loc="MAL 3:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:4">2 Pet 3:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muruhize MUKAMA n'ebigambo byanyu. Kwonka nimugira muti: Tumuruhize tuta? Ahabw'okuba nimugira muti: Buri muntu orikukora ebibi ni murungi omu maisho ga Ruhanga, kandi naabashemerererwa. Nari shi nimubuuza muti: Ruhanga ocwa emanja z'oburyo arahi?<verse eid="MAL 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ebirikuhanuurwa aha kwija kwa Yohaana Omubatizi n'okwa Mukama waitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa 40:3</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:10">Mat 11:10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:2">Mak 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:76">Luk 1:76</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:27">7:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, nintuma entumwa yangye kutebeekanisa omuhanda omu maisho gangye, kandi Mukama, ou murikusherura, aryaija omuri hekalu ye kitaraariire; n'entumwa y'endagaano ei murikushemerererwa, reeba neija; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. <verse eid="MAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 4:4">Isa 4:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:11">Yoel 2:11</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu n'oha oribaasa kwemera eizooba eri ariiziraho, kandi ku arireebwa, n'oha oribaasa kwemereraho? Ahabw'okuba ni nk'omuriro gw'omuheesi ogurikushemeza, kandi nka sabuuni y'omwozi. <verse eid="MAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:25">Isa 1:25</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 13:9">Zek 13:9</ref>. </char></note> Aryashutama nk'orikushemeza efeeza akagimaramu enkamba, ashemeze Abaleevi, abagire nk'oku bamara enkamba omu zaabu n'efeeza, okuhitsya obu barihongyera MUKAMA empongano zihikire. <verse eid="MAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:40">Ezk 20:40</ref>. </char></note> Obwo nibwo empongano za Yuda na Yerusaalemu zirishemeza MUKAMA, nk'oku zaabaire zimushemeza omu biro bya ira, omu myaka eyaahingwire.<verse eid="MAL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 3:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:13">Lev 19:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:17">Bir 24:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:23">Yer 29:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima ndyabairira haihi kucwa orubanja; ndyaba mushinja orikurahuka kushinja abarogi, abashambani, abarikurahira ebishuba, abarikwima abakozi ebihembo byabo, abarikwita kubi abafaakazi n'efuuzi, abarikwita emanja z'abanyamahanga n'abatarikuntiina; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. <verse eid="MAL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 102:27">Zab 102:27</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 3:22">Tonz 3:22</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba nyowe MUKAMA timpinduka; nikyo imwe beene Yakobo mutarikumarirwaho.<verse eid="MAL 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekibi ky'okutaha Ruhanga kimwe kya ikumi n'emitoijo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 1:3">Zek 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:51">Byak 7:51</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwiha omu biro bya baashwenkuriimwe mutuura nimuteishuka nimureka ebiragiro byangye, mutarikubyorobera. Mungarukire, naanye niinyija kubagarukira; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. Kwonka nimugira muti: Tugarukye tuta? <verse eid="MAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:10">Neh 13:10</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu akaabaasa kwima Ruhanga ebye? Kwonka imwe nimuunyima ebyangye. Haza mugira muti: Nitukwima tuta? Nimuunyima ebicweka bya kimwe kya ikumi n'emitoijo. <verse eid="MAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 3:9" />Mukyeenirwe omukyeeno, ahabw'okuba imwe eihanga ryona nimuunyima ebyangye. <verse eid="MAL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:11">Kut 7:11</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:9">Enf 3:9</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 3:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 9:6-8">2 Kor 9:6-8</ref>. </char></note> Mureete ebicweka bya kimwe kya ikumi ebihikire omu mabiikiro gangye, enju yangye ebone kubamu eby'okurya, mubingyerese, haza mureebe ku ntaabaigurira madirisa g'omu iguru, nkabashukaho omugisha, mukabura n'ah'okuguta; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. <verse eid="MAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 3:11" />Ndyakabukira orikwenda kubamira, arekye kucwekyereza emyaka y'omu itaka ryanyu, n'emizaabibu yaanyu teribura kwana; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. <verse eid="MAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 62:4">Isa 62:4</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:19">Zef 3:19</ref>. </char></note> Kandi obwo amahanga goona garyabeeta abahiiriirwe, ahabw'okuba muryaba ensi y'okushemererwa; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira.<verse eid="MAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 3:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 2:17">Mal 2:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Ebigambo ebi mubaire nimuunyetomboitera bigumire. Kwonka nimugira muti: Tukwetomboiteire tuta? <verse eid="MAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:15">Yob 21:15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 1:12">Zef 1:12</ref>. </char></note> Mugizire muti: Tikiine mugasho kukorera Ruhanga. Kandi muti: Nikitugasira ki okworobera ebiragiro bye n'okugyendera omu maisho ga MUKAMA ow'amahe, turi nk'abari omu rufu? <verse eid="MAL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 3:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:9">Zab 95:9</ref>. </char></note> Hati abanyamaryo nibo turikweta abahiiriirwe; kandi enkozi z'ebibi tizirikugogyera kwonka; n'obu zirikugyeza Ruhanga, nizikira.<verse eid="MAL 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 3:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 32:32">Kur 32:32</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:6">Bir 6:6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 6:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo abaabaire nibatiina MUKAMA baaguma nibagambirana; MUKAMA yaatega amatu, yaabahurira, kandi ekitambo ekirimu ebirikwijutsya kyahandiikirwa omu maisho ge ahabw'abaabaire nibatiina MUKAMA, bakateekateeka aha iziina rye. <verse eid="MAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Kur 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:31">Byak 17:31</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pet 2:9</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA ow'amahe naagira ati: Aha izooba eri ndikoreraho, baryaba abangye, babe eitungo ryangye eritoorainwe; kandi ndyabasaasira, nk'oku omuntu asaasira omwana we orikumukorera; <verse eid="MAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAL 3:18" />haza obwo muryagaruka mumanye kutaanisa abahikiriire n'ababi, abarikukorera Ruhanga n'abatarikumukorera.<verse eid="MAL 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAL 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ekiro ky'okugaruka kwa MUKAMA waitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 47:14">Isa 47:14</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:2">Mal 3:2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:12">Mat 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 1:7">2 Tes 1:7</ref>, <ref loc="2TH 1:8">8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba reeba, eizooba niriija, niryotsya nk'etanuuru, obu abanyamaryo n'enkozi z'ebibi bariba nk'ebitsintsi by'embuba; ekyo kiro ekiriija kiryabookyeza kimwe, tikiribatsigira muzi n'obu ryakuba eitaagi; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. <verse eid="MAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 84:11">Zab 84:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 53:5">Isa 53:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:78">Luk 1:78</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Yoh 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:46">12:46</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka imwe abarikutiina eiziina ryangye, eizooba ry'okuhikiirira riryaturuka ahabwanyu, riine okutamba omu mapapa gaaryo. Muryashohora nimukina nk'enyana zirikuruga omu kihongore. <verse eid="MAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 4:3" />Aha izooba eri ndikoreraho, muryaribatiirira ababi, babe eiju ahansi y'ebigyere byanyu; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira.<verse eid="MAL 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 4:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:3-17">Kur 20:3-17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:9">Bir 4:9</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 4:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mwijukye ebiragiro by'omuheereza wangye Musa, ebyatairweho n'emigyenzo ei naamuragiriire ahari Horebu ahabwa Israeli yoona.<verse eid="MAL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 4:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:31">Yoel 2:31</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mat 11:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, ndyabooherereza nabi Eliya, ekiro kya MUKAMA ekikuru kandi ekirikutiinisa kitakaizire. <verse eid="MAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:4">Isa 11:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:17">Luk 1:17</ref>. </char></note> Niwe arihindura emitima y'abazaire bakagarukana n'abaana baabo, n'ey'abaana bakagarukana n'abazaire baabo, ngu ntakaija nkaitsa ensi omukyeeno.<verse eid="MAL 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 4" />
</usx>